scription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-05-15T21:19:41Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T21:22:51Z","closed_at":"2025-05-31T21:21:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.4.1-stable\nNot reproducible in Godot 4.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7270) - AMD Ryzen 7 3800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI believe that _process_modification in SkeletonModifier3D inherited nodes should not be run before the node is ready.\nIn Godot 4.4.1, I noticed that it happens and I use \"@onready var skeleton : Skeleton3D = get_skeleton()\". 'skeleton' is not initialised before I call it in _process_modification, resulting in an error while trying to access a property of 'skeleton'.\n\nI think the issue comes from this line which executes when the Skeleton3D node enters the tree: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b7b3a1a78ad07591fa64e471ef5d42c1166e33e7/scene/3d/skeleton_3d.cpp#L326\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1.Setup a scene with a node3d\n2.Add a Skeleton to the scene\n3.Create the ModifierProcess class with the code below\n4.Add a ModifierProcess node to the skeleton\n5.Run the scene\n\nYou will observe that in 4.4.1, _process_modification executes before _ready (not the same in 4.3).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP in 4.3:\n[SkeletonModifier.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20266244/SkeletonModifier.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106463/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106463/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}